{
    "title": "MapGame",
    "description": "Guess the hidden country on a map every day!\r\n\r\nMeet MapGame, a fun and challenging geography game:\r\n\r\n- Today's Game: Each day, there's a new country to guess for everyone around the world. Use the hints and move around the map to figure out the correct answer! \r\n\r\n- Helpful Hints: Who knew hints could be this interesting?! They range from \u201cThe country is west of Congo\u201d to facts about the country's flag colors or its capital city.\r\n\r\n- More Guesses, More Hints: Can't get the guess in the first go? No problem. Every wrong guess unlocks another hint to help you out.\r\n\r\n- It's a New Day, It's a New Game: A new quiz appears every midnight. Test your knowledge with fresh challenges every day.\r\n\r\n- Share and Compare: Finished the challenge? Share your results and compete with friends.\r\n\r\n- Free to Play: Good news! MapGame is totally free. Plus, after completing the day's challenge, you get access to a special Practice mode.\r\n\r\n- Stats: Keep track of your stats, including average time, win percentage, max streak and more.\r\n\r\nGet ready to sharpen your geography skills with MapGame. \r\n\r\nJoin in and start exploring the world on your screen, one country at a time. Download today and let the fun begin!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Guess the hidden country on a map every day!<br><br>Meet MapGame, a fun and challenging geography game:<br><br>- Today&#39;s Game: Each day, there&#39;s a new country to guess for everyone around the world. Use the hints and move around the map to figure out the correct answer! <br><br>- Helpful Hints: Who knew hints could be this interesting?! They range from \u201cThe country is west of Congo\u201d to facts about the country&#39;s flag colors or its capital city.<br><br>- More Guesses, More Hints: Can&#39;t get the guess in the first go? No problem. Every wrong guess unlocks another hint to help you out.<br><br>- It&#39;s a New Day, It&#39;s a New Game: A new quiz appears every midnight. Test your knowledge with fresh challenges every day.<br><br>- Share and Compare: Finished the challenge? Share your results and compete with friends.<br><br>- Free to Play: Good news! MapGame is totally free. Plus, after completing the day&#39;s challenge, you get access to a special Practice mode.<br><br>- Stats: Keep track of your stats, including average time, win percentage, max streak and more.<br><br>Get ready to sharpen your geography skills with MapGame. <br><br>Join in and start exploring the world on your screen, one country at a time. Download today and let the fun begin!",
